# Trace: Silent E→M upgrade followed by eviction
# Tests that dirty data from a silently-upgraded line survives eviction
# Core 0 reads (Exclusive), writes (silent E→M), then fills cache to evict
0 READ 0x0000
0 WRITE 0x0000 0xA1
0 READ 0x0040
0 READ 0x0080
0 READ 0x00C0
0 READ 0x0100
0 READ 0x0140
0 READ 0x0180
0 READ 0x01C0
# Evict the first entry (LRU victim)
0 READ 0x0200
# Core 1 reads the evicted address — should see dirty data 0xA1
1 READ 0x0000
